>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SUB-GIVING.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-A PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 WS-B PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 WS-C PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
01 WS-D PIC 9(5) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-LOGIC.
    DISPLAY "SUB GIVING DEMO STARTED".
    MOVE 10 TO WS-A.
    MOVE 25 TO WS-B.
    DISPLAY "INITIAL A=" WS-A " B=" WS-B.
    SUBTRACT WS-A FROM WS-B GIVING WS-C.
    DISPLAY "SUB A FROM B GIVING C: A=" WS-A " B=" WS-B " C=" WS-C.
    SUBTRACT 5 FROM WS-B.
    DISPLAY "SUB 5 FROM B INPLACE: A=" WS-A " B=" WS-B " C=" WS-C.
    SUBTRACT WS-A FROM WS-B GIVING WS-D.
    DISPLAY "SUB A FROM B GIVING D: A=" WS-A " B=" WS-B " D=" WS-D.
    DISPLAY "SUB GIVING DEMO COMPLETED".
    STOP RUN.
